title: 'statement-store: v2 soak step, node joining shifts the replica layout'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    In this PR, we extend the v2 DHT soak with a full node joining an active network. Load starts before the newcomer is spawned and continues until all nodes learn the new peer and the topology converges.

    Fresh probes submitted through the XOR-farthest node must land on exactly the new top-K. For shifted topics, the newcomer holds the statements and the displaced replica does not; control topics keep their replica set. Placement checks use `TopicFilter::Any` to avoid granting explicit affinity. The join and a subsequent ordinary wave are mandatory, including with a zero soak duration.

    Closes #13185. Part of #13162.
crates: []
